        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "极地的保护与和平利用",
          "block_bbox": [
            290,
            914,
            866,
            975
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(1)生态环境危机：",
          "block_bbox": [
            301,
            1011,
            748,
            1076
          ],
          "block_id": 6,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "近年来南极地区大量的鲸和北极地区的北极熊、海豹、海狮海象等动物遭到人们的滥杀.\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            297,
            1103,
            1980,
            1263
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "(2)主要措施：",
          "block_bbox": [
            308,
            1294,
            644,
            1354
          ],
          "block_id": 8,
          "block_order": 8
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "为了保护南极的生态环境，和平利用南极，1959年12月，澳大利亚.阿根廷等12个国家签订]《南极条约》，我国于1983年正式加入《南极条约》.",
          "block_bbox": [
            300,
            1386,
            1992,
            1548
          ],
          "block_id": 9,
          "block_order": 9
        },
        {
          "block_label": "number",
          "block_content": "49",
          "block_bbox": [
            1058,
